WEBVTT

00:04:29.181 --> 00:04:31.267
from one person to another

00:04:31.267 --> 00:04:33.019
using blockchain.

00:04:33.811 --> 00:04:37.648
Any asset can now be tokenized,

00:04:37.648 --> 00:04:39.066
digitized

00:04:39.066 --> 00:04:40.192
and traded.

00:04:40.693 --> 00:04:46.657
So technology is not
only disrupting the need

00:04:46.657 --> 00:04:49.035
for a financial intermediary

00:04:49.035 --> 00:04:51.037
in mainstream economy

00:04:51.037 --> 00:04:53.956
but also has the potential

00:04:53.956 --> 00:04:58.627
to disrupt and democratize economic power

00:04:58.627 --> 00:05:00.838
in more rural economies.